            <ArticleTitle>Management of concomitant, symptomatic surgical lesions of the coronary and carotid arteries.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>70-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The surgical management of a patient with symptomatic lesions of the carotid and coronary arteries is presented. The association of these lesions is discussed along with the rationale of a combined surgical approach.</AbstractText>
